      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T22:14:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had a quick chat with Nathan about setProvisionedValue but what is the purpose of getProvisionedValue? What values does the FW needs to know and if we are hiding what will be the proper way of providing those values?",
